   "start_page": 469,
   "summary": "This document is a tabular index of seventy-five diplomatic despatches sent by the American Embassy in Tokyo to the Department of State between November 2 and November 30, 1939. The despatches address embassy administration, consular personnel, commercial treaty negotiations, Japanese domestic press reactions, and export restrictions. A significant proportion of the entries details Japanese military searches and substantial property damage sustained by American Christian missions, schools, and commercial enterprises throughout China.",
   "title": "Despatches Sent to the Department, November 1939",
   "to": "Department of State"
  },
  {
